# Copy to `patterns.local` (gitignored) and fill in.
#
# One extended regex per line, matched case-insensitively, against both staged
# content and the commit message. A match blocks the commit and the hook prints
# only that a private pattern matched — never which one.
#
# What belongs here: anything whose presence in the repo is the problem, so it
# cannot go in the tracked `patterns` file.
#
#   - your own wallet addresses (a 12-char prefix is enough and is not itself
#     a usable address)
#   - your own SuiNS names
#   - any handle you do not want tied to this repo
#
# Examples, with the values replaced:
#
# 0xdeadbeef1234
# 0xfeedface5678
# mywallet\.sui
# some-handle
